{"id":374,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"成長段階に応じた6年間の一貫教育","feature_description":"栄光学園は中高6年間を初級・中級・上級の2学年単位に分け、発達段階ごとに指導目標と方法を設定する。初級では授業と家庭学習を結びつけ、自律した学習習慣と基本的な生活習慣を身につける。中級では多様な学習体験から自ら問題を見いだし、学びを深める姿勢を養う。上級では学習を総合し、自分の適性を確かめて将来の生き方を考える。発達段階に合わせて学びをつなぐ。","clubs":[{"id":6858,"name":"生物研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6859,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6860,"name":"物理研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6861,"name":"ブラスバンド部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6862,"name":"囲碁将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6863,"name":"歴史研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6864,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6865,"name":"クイズ研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6866,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13514,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13515,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13516,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13517,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://eiko.ed.jp/life/kagai/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13518,"name":"ソフトテニス部","catego